<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Babu Ram v. C.B.I., CRL.A. 559/2007</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Justice Vimal Kumar Yadav</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Decided</th><td>4 November 2026 (reserved 3 August 2026)</td></tr>
